---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import InnerHero from "../components/InnerHero.astro";
import { business } from "../data/business";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="Read how the LT Janitorial website handles quote details, email links, scheduling links, and connected services."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <InnerHero
    eyebrow="Privacy notice"
    title="A clear account of how this website handles your information."
    intro="The quote planner does not submit information to a website database. It prepares an email inside your own mail application."
    image="/images/generated/commercial-cleaning-hero.webp"
    imageAlt="Quiet commercial lobby with refined architectural finishes"
    primaryHref={business.emailHref}
    primaryLabel="Email LT Janitorial"
    secondaryHref="/contact"
    secondaryLabel="Contact options"
  />

  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="shell legal prose">
      <p>Last prepared August 31, 2026.</p>
      <h2>Current quote planner</h2>
      <p>The quote planner runs in your browser. When you submit it, the website prepares a message using an email link and opens your configured email application. The website does not send the form to a database, store the field values on a server, or notify LT Janitorial until you choose to send the email.</p>
      <h2>Direct links</h2>
      <p>Telephone links can open your device dialer. Email links can open your mail application. The facility walk through link opens Calendly, and public profile links can open Google, Facebook, or Instagram. Those services maintain their own privacy practices.</p>
      <h2>Analytics and connected services</h2>
      <p>This website does not currently use a customer database, advertising tracker, or form analytics provider. If new services are added, this notice should be updated to explain what they process and what choices visitors have.</p>
      <h2>Business contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this notice can be directed to <a href={business.emailHref}>{business.email}</a> or <a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 54rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }
</style>
